activity Assess Client Needs
activity Develop Service Plan
activity Obtain Funding Approval
activity Provide Counseling Services
activity Coordinate Support Services
activity Monitor Client Progress
activity Adjust Service Plan
activity Conduct Home Visit
activity Close Client File
activity Refer to Specialist
bind Assess Client Needs: Client Risk Level
bind Develop Service Plan: Service Plan Duration
bind Obtain Funding Approval: Funding Amount Requested
bind Provide Counseling Services: Counseling Type
bind Coordinate Support Services: Support Service Type
bind Monitor Client Progress: Progress Score
bind Adjust Service Plan: Plan Adjustment Reason
bind Conduct Home Visit: Home Visit Outcome
bind Close Client File: File Closure Reason
bind Refer to Specialist: Specialist Type
Client Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Service Plan Duration: integer between 1 and 12
Funding Amount Requested: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Counseling Type: Individual, Group, Family
Support Service Type: Housing, Job Training, Childcare
Progress Score: integer between 0 and 100
Plan Adjustment Reason: Progress, Setback, New Needs
Home Visit Outcome: Positive, Neutral, Negative
File Closure Reason: Goals Met, Client Moved, Services Declined
Specialist Type: Psychiatrist, Addiction Counselor, Legal Aid
Init[Assess Client Needs] | |
End[Close Client File] | |
Existence[Monitor Client Progress] | |
Absence3[Refer to Specialist] | |
Exactly[Develop Service Plan] | |
Responded Existence[Adjust Service Plan, Monitor Client Progress] | | |
Precedence[Develop Service Plan, Assess Client Needs] | |T.Client Risk Level in (Low, Medium, High) |
Precedence[Provide Counseling Services, Develop Service Plan] | | |
Precedence[Coordinate Support Services, Obtain Funding Approval] | |T.Funding Amount Requested >= 100.0 AND T.Funding Amount Requested <= 10000.0 |
Response[Assess Client Needs, Conduct Home Visit] |A.Client Risk Level is High |T.Home Visit Outcome in (Positive, Neutral, Negative) |
Response[Develop Service Plan, Obtain Funding Approval] | |T.Funding Amount Requested >= 100.0 AND T.Funding Amount Requested <= 10000.0 |
Succession[Monitor Client Progress, Adjust Service Plan] | |T.Plan Adjustment Reason in (Progress, Setback, New Needs) |
Alternate Response[Refer to Specialist, Monitor Client Progress] |A.Specialist Type in (Psychiatrist, Addiction Counselor, Legal Aid) | |
Chain Response[Conduct Home Visit, Adjust Service Plan] |A.Home Visit Outcome is Negative |T.Plan Adjustment Reason is Setback |
Chain Precedence[Close Client File, Monitor Client Progress] | | |
Co-Existence[Coordinate Support Services, Obtain Funding Approval] | | |
Choice[Provide Counseling Services, Refer to Specialist] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Close Client File, Adjust Service Plan] |A.File Closure Reason is Goals Met | |
Not Responded Existence[Close Client File, Refer to Specialist] |A.File Closure Reason is Client Moved | |
Not Precedence[Close Client File, Develop Service Plan] | | |
Not Response[Close Client File, Assess Client Needs] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Close Client File, Assess Client Needs] | | |